    "problem_statement": "The non-cryptographic random API only exposes per-type Get* helpers and *InRange helpers that require a strictly-ordered min/max and cannot express a closed [min,max] range or a [0,max) range by a single typed call. Provide a single template-based API that, for an unsigned integer type, generates a full-range random value, a random value in [0, aMax), a random value in [aMin, aMax) (returning aMin when aMax <= aMin), and a random value in the closed range [aMin, aMax] (returning aMin when aMax < aMin). Boundary cases must be handled correctly: a zero upper bound returns zero, an empty or inverted range returns the lower bound, and the upper bound of a closed range can actually be returned.",
